Personal knowledge base — Markdown notes, fzf browser with preview.

  kb                         browser: enter view · ctrl-e edit · ctrl-n new (query = name)
                             ctrl-x delete · ctrl-y copy · ctrl-d full text · ctrl-f list
  kb <topic/name>            show an entry (glow)
  kb new  <topic/name>       create from template in nvim
  kb edit <topic/name>       edit in nvim
  kb rm   <topic/name>       delete after confirmation
  kb search <text…>          full text search in the browser
  kb list                    all entries with titles

Entries: ~/.local/state/lpex/data/kb/<topic>/<name>.md (backed up with the private state repo).
Never store passwords or tokens here — note the Vaultwarden entry instead,
e.g. rbw get 'client - forgejo' --field mgit-token
